1.0.1 10nov2026
* Fix startup crash on weewx 4.x. version_compare only exists in weewx 5.0
  and later, so fall back to a local comparison when it is missing.
* Log the reason for each failed upload attempt (info for retries, error on
  the last). weewx logs these at debug only, so network faults such as DNS
  failures showed only "Failed upload after 3 tries".

1.0 29sep2026
* Migrated to Windy Stations API v2 (/api/v2/observation/update).
  The legacy API shuts down at the end of 2026.
* Authenticate with the per-station password, sent as a Bearer token.
  The account API key no longer works for uploads.
* New required options station_id and password replace api_key and station.
* Send winddir as an integer; the v2 API rejects decimal values.
* Handle v2 responses: stop on bad password, skip duplicates (409) and
  rate-limited uploads (429).
* Default post_interval is 300 and stale is 7200 to match the v2 limits.
* Installer prompts for station_id and password, and checks them against
  the v2 API. On upgrade it comments out api_key and station and keeps any
  comments in the [[Windy]] section.

0.8 04mar2026
* Removed references to distutils. -tk
* Minimum supported version of WeeWX is 4.1.

0.7 08may2020
* Ported to WeeWX V4 logging facility. -tk

0.6 09jan2020
* deal with None for observation readings

